Always-fresh skills: hardened updater, git hooks, submodule bump

- update_skills(force=True, default): fetch origin/main, preserve any local
  drift on backup/local-<ts> branch, then hard-reset skills/ to origin/main.
  check_for_updates now flags a dirty working tree as "needs update" so
  ensure_fresh triggers the force path automatically.
- /install-git-hooks + python -m uipath_claude.hooks.install_git_hooks:
  install post-merge, post-checkout, post-rewrite hooks that run
  `git submodule update --init --remote --merge skills` best-effort on every
  pull/checkout/rebase. Idempotent, worktree-safe, skips unmarked user hooks
  without --force.
- Submodule bumped a67ee6d -> 17fe4ba (upstream advance). Prior local drift
  in the working tree was moved to backup/local-1776519469.
- Docs: TOOLS.md and CAPABILITY_PARITY.md updated.
- Tests: tests/unit/skills/test_updater.py (4 cases),
  tests/unit/hooks/test_install_git_hooks.py (5 cases). Full suite
  649 passed, 4 skipped.
